### ==============================================================================
### FaceCheck API - VS Code Interactive HTTP Test Suite
### Compatible with VS Code "REST Client" extension or curl
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@apiKey = fc-prod-secret-key-bank-core-9872

### 1. Health & Offline Guarantee Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Prometheus Observability Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/metrics
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3. Check Image Verification (Authentic Real Face Photo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/check
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck

------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="portrait_01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./eval/data/real/portrait_01.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck--

### 4. Check Image Verification (Synthetic 3D Cartoon AI Face)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/check
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck

------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cartoon_01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./eval/data/fake/3d_cartoons/cartoon_01.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck--

### 5. Check Image Verification (AI Diffusion Generation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/check
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck

------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="midjourney_v6_portrait.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./eval/data/fake/diffusion_ai/midjourney_v6_portrait.png
------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck--

### 6. Check Image Verification (Landscape / No Human Face)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/check
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck

------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mountain_billboard.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./eval/data/non_face/landscapes/mountain_billboard.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck--

### 7. Unauthorized Test (Missing X-API-Key -> 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/check
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck

------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./eval/data/real/portrait_01.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryFaceCheck--
